<% layout('layouts/boilerplate') %>

<div style="max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 40px 20px;">

    <h2 style="font-weight:700; margin-bottom:25px; text-align:center;">
        Privacy Policy
    </h2>

    <div style="line-height:1.7; font-size:16px; color:#333;">

        <p style="margin-bottom:18px; text-align:justify;">
            We value your privacy and are committed to protecting your personal information. This Privacy Policy explains how PetNest collects, uses, and safeguards your data when you use our platform.
        </p>

        <h3 style="margin-top:25px; margin-bottom:10px;">1. Information We Collect</h3>
        <p style="margin-bottom:18px; text-align:justify;">
            We may collect basic personal details such as your name, email address, phone number, and pet-related information when you register, book appointments, or interact with our services.
        </p>

        <h3 style="margin-top:25px; margin-bottom:10px;">2. How We Use Your Information</h3>
        <p style="margin-bottom:18px; text-align:justify;">
            Your information is used to manage appointments, provide pet services, improve user experience, and maintain communication regarding your bookings and updates.
        </p>

        <h3 style="margin-top:25px; margin-bottom:10px;">3. Data Protection</h3>
        <p style="margin-bottom:18px; text-align:justify;">
            We implement appropriate security measures to ensure your data is stored safely. Access to personal information is restricted and only used for necessary operations.
        </p>

        <h3 style="margin-top:25px; margin-bottom:10px;">4. Sharing of Information</h3>
        <p style="margin-bottom:18px; text-align:justify;">
            We do not sell, trade, or rent your personal information to third parties. Your data may only be shared when required by law or to complete a service request.
        </p>

        <h3 style="margin-top:25px; margin-bottom:10px;">5. Cookies and Tracking</h3>
        <p style="margin-bottom:18px; text-align:justify;">
            Our platform may use basic cookies to improve user experience and maintain session information for smooth navigation.
        </p>

        <h3 style="margin-top:25px; margin-bottom:10px;">6. User Consent</h3>
        <p style="margin-bottom:18px; text-align:justify;">
            By using PetNest, you agree to the collection and use of information as described in this Privacy Policy.
        </p>

        <h3 style="margin-top:25px; margin-bottom:10px;">7. Contact Details</h3>

        <p style="margin-bottom:10px; text-align:justify;">
            If you have any questions, concerns, or requests regarding this Privacy Policy, you can reach us at:
        </p>

        <p style="margin-bottom:6px;">
            📧 Email: support@petnest.com
        </p>

        <p style="margin-bottom:6px;">
            📞 Phone: +91 9503828389
        </p>

        <p style="margin-bottom:18px;">
            📍 Address: PetNest Services, Salt Lake, Kolkata ,India
        </p>

    </div>

</div>